OL,5,G0020 Frasier
OL,6,     FMoving In: Frasier hopes to make
OL,7,     Fup for lost time with Freddy, but
OL,8,     Fa disagreement over where to put a
OL,9,     Fsmall Red Sox souvenir quickly
OL,10,     Fescalates into a battle of wills
OL,11,     Fbetween father and son.
OL,12,G0050 Suspect
OL,13,     FSapphire: Finally managing to
OL,14,     Ftrack down the witness, Susannah
OL,15,     Fmeets Sapphire, an escort, who
OL,16,     Fgives Susannah even more shocking
OL,17,     Fnews than she was ever expecting.
OL,18,G0125 Suspect
OL,19,     FJoseph: Susannah turns to
OL,20,     Fex-client and Royal Marine Joseph.
OL,21,     FAs they search the Thames for
OL,22,     FSapphire, gunmen close in.
